tion environment, in accordance with best practices, when customers leave the service."}, {:control_id=>"UNC 38", :control_text=>"The company has a data classification policy in place to help ensure that confidential data is properly secured and restricted to authorized personnel."}], :pdf_control_mappings=>{:mappings=>[{:source_control_ids=>["CC 6.6", "CC 6.7"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 1"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"Source control explicitly states use of secure data transmission protocols to encrypt data over public networks, which includes TLS."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 6.1"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 2"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"Source control states datastores housing sensitive data are encrypted at rest, fully matching the core intent."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 1.1", "CC 1.5", "CC 2.2", "CC 5.1", "CC 5.2", "CC 5.3"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 3"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"Multiple source controls collectively address employee and contractor codes of conduct, disciplinary actions for violations, and documented information security policies, covering acceptable use and security expectations."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 1.3", "CC 2.2", "CC 7.1", "CC 7.2"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 4"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"Source controls explicitly mention defined roles and responsibilities for overseeing information security controls and outlining requirements for IT/Engineering functions like vulnerability management and system monitoring."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 1.4", "CC 2.2"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 5"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"Source control requires security awareness training within thirty days of hire (onboarding) and annually thereafter (periodic)."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 2.2", "CC 5.1", "CC 5.2", "CC 5.3", "CC 7.3", "CC 7.4", "CC 7.5"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 6"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"Source controls ens