blished defined roles and responsibilities to oversee information security controls."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 1.4", "CC 2.2"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 5"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"The source control explicitly requires employees to complete security awareness training within thirty days of hire (onboarding) and annually thereafter (periodic)."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 2.2", "CC 5.1", "CC 5.2", "CC 5.3", "CC 2.2", "CC 5.3", "CC 7.3", "CC 7.4", "CC 7.5"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 6"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"Multiple source controls confirm that information security policies and procedures are documented and, in some cases, explicitly communicated to authorized users."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 2.3"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 7"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"The source control describes an external-facing support system for users to report incidents and other concerns to appropriate personnel, defining a channel."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 2.2", "CC 5.1", "CC 5.2", "CC 5.3", "CC 2.2", "CC 5.3", "CC 7.3", "CC 7.4", "CC 7.5"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 8"], :match_type=>"partial", :rationale=>"While source controls indicate policies are documented and communicated, there is no explicit statement about communicating *changes* to security policies to all relevant stakeholders."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 3.2", "CC 3.3", "CC 3.4", "CC 7.1", "CC 9.1"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 9"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"The source control explicitly states that risk assessments are performed at least annually, covering periodic enterprise risk assessments."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 3.1", "CC 3.2", "CC 3.3", "CC 3.4", "CC 5.1", "CC 5.3", "CC 9.1", "CC 3.2", "CC 3.3", "CC 3.4", "CC 7.1", "CC 9.1", "CC 1.2"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 10"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"Source controls describe a documented risk management program where risks are identified and formally assessed, and the board is briefed on cybersecurity and privacy risk, indicating management review."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 3.1", "CC 3.2", "CC 3.3", "CC 3.4", "CC 5.1", "CC 5.3", "CC 9.1"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 11"], :match_type=>"partial", :rationale=>"The source control mentions mitigation strategies as part of a documented risk management program, which implies risk treatment decisions. However, it doesn't explicitly state that these decisions are 'recorded and tracked'."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 2.1", "CC 7.2"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 12"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"The source control explicitly states the utilization of a log management tool to identify events, which covers collecting and monitoring system logs."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 7.2", "CC 6.6", "CC 7.2"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 13"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"Source controls describe infrastructure monitoring tools and intrusion detection systems that generate alerts for predefined thresholds or potential security breaches, covering anomalous system activity."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 2.1", "CC 4.1", "CC 4.2"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 14"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"The source control explicitly states that the company performs annual control self-assessments to ensure controls are operating effectively, which constitutes periodic review of control performance by management."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 5.2", "CC 5.3", "CC 6.8", "CC 8.1", "CC 5.3", "CC 7.1", "CC 8.1"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 15"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"Source controls define a formal SDLC methodology that governs changes to information systems and explicitly detail requirements for authorizing, documenting, testing, reviewing, and approving changes to software and infrastructure components."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 5.3", "CC 7.1", "CC 8.1"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 16"], :