n policy."}], :unmatched_source_controls=>[], :unmatched_normalized_controls=>[{:control_id=>"PNC 26", :control_text=>"Deployment processes include rollback mechanisms"}]}, :url_control_mappings=>{:mappings=>[], :unmatched_source_controls=>[{:control_ids=>["CC 1.1", "CC 1.4"], :normalised_control_text=>"The company performs background checks on new employees."}, {:control_ids=>["CC 1.1"], :normalised_control_text=>"The company requires contractor agreements to include a code of conduct or reference to the company code of conduct."}, {:control_ids=>["CC 1.1", "CC 1.5"], :normalised_control_text=>"The company requires employees to acknowledge a code of conduct at the time of hire. Employees who violate the code of conduct are subject to disciplinary actions in accordance with a disciplinary policy."}, {:control_ids=>["CC 1.1"], :normalised_control_text=>"The company requires contractors to sign a confidentiality agreement at the time of engagement."}, {:control_ids=>["CC 1.1"], :normalised_control_text=>"The company requires employees to sign a confidentiality agreement during onboarding."}, {:control_ids=>["CC 1.1", "CC 1.4", "CC 1.5"], :normalised_control_text=>"The company managers are required to complete performance evaluations for direct reports at least annually."}, {:control_ids=>["CC 1.2", "CC 1.3"], :normalised_control_text=>"The company's board of directors has a documented charter that outlines its oversight responsibilities for internal control."}, {:control_ids=>["CC 1.2"], :normalised_control_text=>"The company's board of directors or a relevant subcommittee is briefed by senior management at least annually on the state of the company's cybersecurity and privacy risk. The board provides feedback and direction to management as needed."}, {:control_ids=>["CC 1.3", "CC 2.2"], :normalised_control_text=>"The company management has established defined roles and responsibilities to oversee the design and implementation of information security controls."}, {:co