l, the explicit implementation of 'role-based access control' for systems is not specified."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 6.1", "CC 6.6"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 19"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"The source control explicitly requires multi-factor authentication for authorized employees accessing production systems remotely, covering privileged access."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 5.2", "CC 6.1", "CC 6.2", "CC 6.3", "CC 6.2", "CC 6.3", "CC 6.5"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 20"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Source controls explicitly document requirements for adding and removing user access, and detail procedures for revoking access for terminated employees, covering provisioning and deprovisioning procedures."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 2.2", "CC 5.3", "CC 7.3", "CC 7.4", "CC 7.5"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 21"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"The source control explicitly states that security and privacy incident response policies and procedures are documented."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 7.3", "CC 7.4", "CC 7.5"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 22"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"The source control explicitly states that security and privacy incidents are logged, tracked, and resolved according to policy."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 1.3", "CC 2.2"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 23"], "match_type"=>"partial", "rationale"=>"The source control defines roles and responsibilities for overseeing information security controls, which covers a significant part of operational responsibilities. However, it does not explicitly encompass all general operational responsibilities."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 5.3", "CC 7.1", "CC 8.1"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 24"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"The source control explicitly requires changes to software and infrastructure components to be tested prior to implementation in the production environment."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 5.2", "CC 5.3", "CC 6.8", "CC 8.1", "CC 5.3", "CC 7.1", "CC 8.1"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 25"], "match_type"=>"partial", "rationale"=>"While source controls acknowledge 'emergency changes' within its SDLC, it does not explicitly state that these changes are 'documented following implementation'."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 3.2", "CC 4.1", "CC 4.2", "CC 5.3", "CC 9.2"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 27"], "match_type"=>"partial", "rationale"=>"The source control describes a vendor management program that includes security and privacy requirements for critical third-party vendors, which implies an evaluation process during initial engagement, but 'onboarding' is not explicitly mentioned."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 3.2", "CC 4.1", "CC 4.2", "CC 5.3", "CC 9.2"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 28"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"The source control explicitly states that critical third-party vendors are reviewed at least annually, which covers periodic vendor reviews."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 3.2", "CC 4.1", "CC 4.2", "CC 5.3", "CC 9.2", "CC 3.1", "CC 3.2", "CC 3.3", "CC 3.4", "CC 5.1", "CC 5.3", "CC 9.1"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 29"], "match_type"=>"partial", "rationale"=>"While vendor reviews are conducted, and a general risk management program exists, there is no explicit statement within the vendor management program that identified vendor-specific risks are documented and tracked."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 7.2"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 30"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"The source control states that an infrastructure monitoring tool is used to monitor systems, infrastructure, and performance, which includes system uptime."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 5.3"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 31"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"The source control explicitly states that the company's data backup policy documents requirements for backup and recovery of customer data, implying documented and performed procedures."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 3.2", "CC 7.5"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 32"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"The source control explicitly states the existence of a documented business continuity/disaster recovery (BC/DR) plan and that it is tested at least annually, which covers periodic review."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 6.1"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 33"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"The source control explicitly mentions a data classification policy to help ensure confidential data is secured, indicating sensitive data is classified internally."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 6.1", "CC 6.2", "CC 6.3", "CC 6.4"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 34"], "match_type"=>"partial", "rationale"=>"While source controls state access to confidential data is restricted to authorized personnel, it does not explicitly specify that this restriction is 'based on roles'."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 5.3", "CC 6.5"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 35"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"The source control explicitly mentions formal retention and disposal procedures, which serves as a documented data retention policy."}], "unmatched_source_controls"=>["CC 1.1", "CC 1.4", "CC 1.1", "CC 1.1", "CC 1.1", "CC 1.4", "CC 1.5", "CC 1.2", "CC 1.3", "CC 2.1", "CC 4.1", "CC 7.1", "CC 7.2", "CC 7.4", "CC 8.1", "CC 2.3", "CC 2.3", "CC 9.2", "CC 6.1", "CC 6.1", "CC 6.6", "CC 6.1", "CC 6.5", "CC 6.5", "CC 6.6", "CC 6.8", "CC 7.2", "CC 7.4", "CC 8.1", "CC 6.6", "CC 6.7", "CC 6.7", "CC 6.8", "CC 7.1", "CC 7.2", "CC 7.4", "CC 7.5", "CC 9.1", "CC 6.4", "CC 3.1", "CC 5.3"], "unmatched_normalized_controls"=>["PNC 26"]}
