erns to appropriate personnel, defining a channel."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 2.2", "CC 5.1", "CC 5.2", "CC 5.3", "CC 2.2", "CC 5.3", "CC 7.3", "CC 7.4", "CC 7.5"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 8"], :match_type=>"partial", :rationale=>"While source controls indicate policies are documented and communicated, there is no explicit statement about communicating *changes* to security policies to all relevant stakeholders."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 3.2", "CC 3.3", "CC 3.4", "CC 7.1", "CC 9.1"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 9"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"The source control explicitly states that risk assessments are performed at least annually, covering periodic enterprise risk assessments."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 3.1", "CC 3.2", "CC 3.3", "CC 3.4", "CC 5.1", "CC 5.3", "CC 9.1", "CC 3.2", "CC 3.3", "CC 3.4", "CC 7.1", "CC 9.1", "CC 1.2"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 10"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"Source controls describe a documented risk management program where risks are identified and formally assessed, and the board is briefed on cybersecurity and privacy risk, indicating management review."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 3.1", "CC 3.2", "CC 3.3", "CC 3.4", "CC 5.1", "CC 5.3", "CC 9.1"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 11"], :match_type=>"partial", :rationale=>"The source control mentions mitigation strategies as part of a documented risk management program, which implies risk treatment decisions. However, it doesn't explicitly state that these decisions are 'recorded and tracked'."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 2.1", "CC 7.2"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 12"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"The source control explicitly states the utilization of a log management tool to identify events, which covers collecting and monitoring system logs."}, {:source_control_ids=>["CC 7.2", "CC 6.6", "CC 7.2"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["PNC 13"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"Source controls describe