[Gemini::Chat] parsed content: {"mappings"=>[{"source_control_ids"=>["CC 6.6", "CC 6.7"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 1"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Source control directly states the use of secure data transmission protocols to encrypt confidential and sensitive data when transmitted over public networks, which covers encryption in transit using TLS."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 6.1"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 2"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Source control explicitly states datastores housing sensitive customer data are encrypted at rest. The specific mechanism (cloud provider-managed) is not detailed but the core requirement is met."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 1.1", "CC 1.5", "CC 2.2", "CC 5.1", "CC 5.2", "CC 5.3"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 3"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Multiple source controls cover requiring employees and contractors to acknowledge a code of conduct (acceptable use, employee conduct) and the existence of documented information security policies (security expectations)."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 1.3", "CC 2.2"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 4"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Source control explicitly states that management has established defined roles and responsibilities to oversee the design and implementation of information security controls."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 1.4", "CC 2.2"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 5"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Source control explicitly requires employees to complete security awareness training within thirty days of hire (onboarding) and at least annually thereafter (periodic)."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 2.2", "CC 5.1", "CC 5.2", "CC 5.3", "CC 7.3", "CC 7.4", "CC 7.5"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 6"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Multiple source controls state that information security policies and procedures are documented, and specifically that incident response policies are documented and communicated to authorized users, implying internal communication for relevant policies."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 2.3", "CC 7.3", "CC 7.4", "CC 7.5"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 7"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Source control indicates an external-facing support system for reporting incidents, and incident response policies imply defined channels for reporting and handling."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 2.2", "CC 5.1", "CC 5.2", "CC 5.3", "CC 7.3", "CC 7.4", "CC 7.5"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 8"], "match_type"=>"partial", "rationale"=>"Source controls indicate policies are documented and reviewed, and some are communicated to authorized users, but there is no explicit statement requiring communication of *changes* to security policies to all *relevant stakeholders*."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 3.2", "CC 3.3", "CC 3.4", "CC 7.1", "CC 9.1", "CC 1.2"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 9"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Source control explicitly states that risk assessments are performed at least annually. Additionally, board review of cybersecurity and privacy risk (CC 1.2) contributes to enterprise risk assessment oversight."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 3.1", "CC 3.2", "CC 3.3", "CC 3.4", "CC 5.1", "CC 5.3", "CC 7.1", "CC 9.1", "CC 1.2"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 10"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Source controls describe a documented risk management program that includes identification and rating of risks, and annual formal risk assessments, indicating identified risks are documented. Board review (CC 1.2) confirms management review."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 3.1", "CC 3.2", "CC 3.3", "CC 3.4", "CC 5.1", "CC 5.3", "CC 9.1", "CC 2.1", "CC 4.1", "CC 7.1", "CC 7.2", "CC 7.4", "CC 8.1"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 11"], "match_type"=>"partial", "rationale"=>"Source controls indicate a documented risk management program with mitigation strategies, implying recorded decisions. Vulnerability remediation is tracked to completion, but broader tracking of all risk treatment decisions is not explicitly stated."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 2.1", "CC 7.2"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 12"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Source control explicitly states the utilization of a log management tool to identify events, which semantically covers collecting and monitoring system logs."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 7.2", "CC 2.1", "CC 6.6"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 13"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Source controls describe an infrastructure monitoring tool that generates alerts when predefined thresholds are met, and a log management tool and IDS to identify events, which semantically covers configuring alerts for anomalous activity."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 2.1", "CC 4.1", "CC 4.2"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 14"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Source control explicitly states that control self-assessments are performed at least annually to gain assurance that controls are in place and operating effectively, directly covering periodic review of control performance."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 5.2", "CC 5.3", "CC 6.8", "CC 8.1", "CC 7.1"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 15"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Multiple source controls describe a formal SDLC methodology that governs changes and maintenance, and specific requirements for authorizing, documenting, testing, reviewing, and approving changes to software and infrastructure."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 5.3", "CC 7.1", "CC 8.1"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 16"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Source control explicitly requires changes to software components to be reviewed and approved prior to being implemented in production."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 5.3", "CC 7.1", "CC 8.1"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 17"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Source control explicitly requires changes to infrastructure components to be formally documented, and the overall change process implies tracking."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 5.2", "CC 6.1", "CC 6.2", "CC 6.3"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 18"], "match_type"=>"partial", "rationale"=>"Source controls define access control functions and restrict access to authorized personnel, but do not explicitly use the term 'role-based access control'."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 6.1", "CC 6.6"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 19"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Source control requires multi-factor authentication for remote access to production systems by authorized employees, which semantically covers privileged access."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 5.2", "CC 6.1", "CC 6.2", "CC 6.3", "CC 6.5"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 20"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Source controls explicitly state that the access control policy documents requirements for adding, modifying, and removing user access, and termination checklists ensure access revocation."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 2.2", "CC 5.3", "CC 7.3", "CC 7.4", "CC 7.5"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 21"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Source control explicitly states that security and privacy incident response policies and procedures are documented."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 7.3", "CC 7.4", "CC 7.5"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 22"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Source control explicitly states that security and privacy incidents are logged, tracked, and resolved according to policy."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 1.3", "CC 2.2"], "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["PNC 23"], "match_type"=>"partial", "rationale"=>"Source control explicitly defines roles and responsibilities for information security controls, but a broader statement covering all operational responsibilities is not present."}, {"source_control_ids"=>["CC 5.3", "CC 7.1", "CC 8.1"], "normalized