 for direct reports."}, {"source_row_index"=>6, "source_normalised_control_text"=>"The company's board of directors has a documented charter that outlines its oversight responsibilities for internal control.", "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["UNC 31"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Direct match on board oversight responsibilities."}, {"source_row_index"=>9, "source_normalised_control_text"=>"The company requires employees to complete security awareness training within thirty days of hire and at least annually thereafter.", "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["UNC 28", "UNC 33"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Direct match on cybersecurity awareness training for employees."}, {"source_row_index"=>12, "source_normalised_control_text"=>"The company performs control self-assessments at least annually to gain assurance that controls are in place and operating effectively. Corrective actions are taken based on relevant findings. If the company has committed to an SLA for a finding, the corrective action is completed within that SLA.", "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["UNC 20", "UNC 22"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Matches both control self-assessments and SLA for findings components."}, {"source_row_index"=>19, "source_normalised_control_text"=>"The company has a documented business continuity/disaster recovery (BC/DR) plan and tests it at least annually.", "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["UNC 27"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Direct match on BC/DR plan and testing."}, {"source_row_index"=>21, "source_normalised_control_text"=>"The company has a formal systems development life cycle (SDLC) methodology in place that governs the development, acquisition, implementation, changes (including emergency changes), and maintenance of information systems and related technology requirements.", "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["UNC 32"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"Direct match on formal SDLC methodology."}, {"source_row_index"=>22, "source_nor