[UrlService] body sample (first 1500): "Monitored and Powered by\n\nTrust Center\n\nReport issue\n\nnovoflow.io\n\nfounders@novoflow.io\n\nCompliance\nDocuments\nSecurity Controls\nFAQs\nSOC 2\nHIPAA\nCategories\n\nExplore our security controls by category\n\nAccess Control and Authorization\nData Management and Protection\nDisaster Recovery\nEmail Security\nEndpoint Security\nInfrastructure Security\nMonitoring and Incident Response\nOrganizational Security\nRisk Management\nVulnerability Management\nAccess Control and Authorization\nAccess granting process used\n\nImplement a formal access granting process that ensures new access privileges are assigned based on the principle of least privilege, and require at least one employee to endorse the granting of new access.\n\nAccess management policy established\n\nSystematic controls are established in the access management policy for managing user access rights, ensuring appropriate, authorized access to systems and data.\n\nAccess requests to sensitive data required\n\nTo access sensitive data, employees must submit access requests that are approved and monitored.\n\nAccess requests to sensitive infrastructure required\n\nTo access sensitive infrastructure components, employees must submit access requests that are approved and monitored. This control helps ensure that only authorized personnel can access critical infrastructure, minimizing potential risks.\n\nAccess revoking process enforced\n\nImplement a regular access review process to promptly remove access privileges from employees who no longer require them."
