ess."}, {"source_row_index"=>25, "source_normalised_control_text"=>"The company has formal retention and disposal procedures in place to guide the secure retention and disposal of company and customer data.", "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["UNC 28"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"UNC 28 establishes a data retention and disposal policy, aligning with the source's procedures."}, {"source_row_index"=>26, "source_normalised_control_text"=>"The company's network is segmented to prevent unauthorized access to customer data.", "normalized_common_control_ids"=>[], "match_type"=>"partial", "rationale"=>"UNC 15 restricts public access via firewalls but does not explicitly address network segmentation."}, {"source_row_index"=>27, "source_normalised_control_text"=>"The company's production systems can only be remotely accessed by authorized employees via an approved encrypted connection.", "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["UNC 4"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"UNC 4 requires VPNs for secure remote access, matching the source's encrypted remote access requirement."}, {"source_row_index"=>29, "source_normalised_control_text"=>"The company requires multi-factor authentication (MFA) for accessing sensitive infrastructure. MFA adds an extra layer of security by requiring users to provide additional authentication factors beyond their passwords.", "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["UNC 24"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"UNC 24 specifically requires MFA for sensitive infrastructure, matching the source's MFA requirement."}, {"source_row_index"=>30, "source_normalised_control_text"=>"The company requires passwords for in-scope system components to be configured according to the company's policy.", "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["UNC 11"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"UNC 11 enforces a password management policy, matching the source's password requirements."}, {"source_row_index"=>31, "source_normalised_control_text"=>"The company has a data classification policy in place to help ensure that confidential data is properly secured and restricted to authorized personnel.", "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["UNC 27"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"UNC 27 requires data labeling based on classification, aligning with the source's data classification policy."}, {"source_row_index"=>33, "source_normalised_control_text"=>"The company conducts access reviews at least quarterly for the in-scope system components to help ensure that access is restricted appropriately. Required changes are tracked to completion.", "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["UNC 7"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"UNC 7 mandates annual access reviews, but the source's quarterly reviews exceed this requirement, making it a full match."}, {"source_row_index"=>43, "source_normalised_control_text"=>"The company's formal policies outline the requirements for the following functions related to IT / Engineering: \n- vulnerability management;\n- system monitoring.", "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["UNC 87"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"UNC 87 establishes a vulnerability management policy, covering the source's vulnerability management and monitoring requirements."}, {"source_row_index"=>44, "source_normalised_control_text"=>"An infrastructure monitoring tool is utilized to monitor systems, infrastructure, and performance and generates alerts when specific predefined thresholds are met.", "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["UNC 19"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"UNC 19 requires infrastructure monitoring, matching the source's monitoring tool."}, {"source_row_index"=>46, "source_normalised_control_text"=>"The company tests their incident response plan at least annually.", "normalized_common_control_ids"=>["UNC 46"], "match_type"=>"full", "rationale"=>"UNC 46 mandates annual testing of the incident response plan, matching the source's requirement."}], "unmatched_source_controls"=>[{"source_row_index"=>0, "normalized_control_text"=>"The company performs background checks on new employees."}, {"source_row_index"=>5, "normalized_control_text"=>"The company managers are required to complete performance evaluations for direct reports at least annually."}, {"source_row_index"=>6, "normalized_control_text"=>"The company's board of directors has a documented charter that outlines its oversight responsibilities for internal control."}, {"source_row_index"=>7, "normalized_control_text"=>"The company's board of directors or a relevant subcommittee is briefed by senior management at least annually on the state of the company's cybersecurity and privacy risk. The board provides feedback and direction to management as needed."}, {"source_row_index"=>8, "normalized_control_text"=>"The company management has established defined roles and responsibilities to oversee the design and implementation of information security controls."}, {"source_row_index"=>9, "normalized_control_text"=>"The company requires employees to complete security awareness training within thirty days of hire and at least annually thereafter."}, {"source_row_index"=>11, "normalized_control_text"=>"Host-based vulnerability scans are performed at least quarterly on all external-facing systems. Critical and high vulnerabilities are tracked to remediation."}, {"source_row_index"=>12, "normalized_control_text"=>"The company performs control self-assessments at least annually to gain assurance that controls are in place and operating effectively. Corrective actions are taken based on relevant findings. If the company has committed to an SLA for a finding, the corrective action is completed within that SLA."}, {"source_row_index"=>13, "normalized_control_text"=>"The company's information security policies and procedures are documented and reviewed at least annually."}, {"source_row_index"=>14, "normalized_control_text"=>"The company has an external-facing support system in place that allows users to report system information on failures, incidents, concerns, and other complaints to appropriate personnel."}, {"source_row_index"=>21, "normalized_control_text"=>"The company has a formal systems development life cycle (SDLC) methodology in place that governs the development, acquisition, implementation, changes (including emergency changes), and maintenance of information systems and related technology requirements."}, {"source_row_index"=>28, "normalized_control_text"=>"The company's datastores housing sensitive customer data are encrypted at rest."}, {"source_row_index"=>34, "normalised_control_text"=>"The company purges or removes customer data containing confidential information from the application environment, in accordance with best practices, when customers leave the service."}, {"source_row_index"=>35, "normalised_control_text"=>"The company has electronic media containing confidential information purged or destroyed in accordance with best practices, and certificates of destruction are issued for each device destroyed."}, {"source_row_index"=>36, "normalised_control_text"=>"The company has infrastructure supporting the service patched as a part of routine maintenance and as a result of identified vulnerabilities to help ensure that servers supporting the service are hardened against security threats."}, {"source_row_index"=>37, "normalised_control_text"=>"The company uses an intrusion detection system to provide continuous monitoring of the company's network and early detection of potential security breaches."}, {"source_row_index"=>38, "normalised_control_text"=>"The company uses secure data transmission protocols to encrypt confidential and sensitive data when transmitted over public networks."}, {"source_row_index"=>39, "normalised_control_text"=>"The company reviews its firewall rulesets at least annually. Required changes are tracked to completion."}, {"source_row_index"=>40, "normalised_control_text"=>"The company has a mobile device management (MDM) system in place to centrally manage mobile devices supporting the service."}, {"source_row_index"=>41, "normalised_control_text"=>"The company encrypts portable and removable media devices when used."}, {"source_row_index"=>42, "normalised_control_text"=>"The company deploys anti-malware technology to environments commonly susceptible to malicious attacks and configures this to be updated routinely, logged, and installed on all relevant systems."}, {"source_row_index"=>45, "normalised_control_text"=>"The company adopts an infrastructure-as-code (IaC) approach to deploy and manage the organization's infrastructure components. IaC tools enable consistent and version-controlled infrastructure deployment, reducing the risk of configuration errors."}, {"source_row_index"=>47, "normalised_control_text"=>"The company maintains cybersecurity insurance to mitigate the financial impact of business disruptions."}, {"source_row_index"=>48, "normalised_control_text"=>"The company has processes in place for granting, changing, and terminating physical access to company data centers based on an authorization from control owners."}, {"source_row_index"=>50, "normalised_control_text"=>"The company specifies its objectives to enable the identification and assessment of risk related to the objectives."}], "unmatched_normalized_controls"=>[]}
