omalous system activity"}, {:control_id=>"PNC 26", :control_text=>"Vendors are evaluated during onboarding"}, {:control_id=>"PNC 27", :control_text=>"Vendor reviews are conducted periodically"}, {:control_id=>"PNC 28", :control_text=>"Identified vendor risks are documented and tracked"}, {:control_id=>"PNC 29", :control_text=>"System uptime is monitored"}, {:control_id=>"PNC 30", :control_text=>"Backup procedures are documented and performed"}, {:control_id=>"PNC 31", :control_text=>"Disaster recovery plans exist and are reviewed periodically"}, {:control_id=>"PNC 32", :control_text=>"Sensitive data is classified internally"}, {:control_id=>"PNC 33", :control_text=>"Access to sensitive data is restricted based on roles"}, {:control_id=>"PNC 34", :control_text=>"Data retention policies are documented"}, {:control_id=>"PNC 35", :control_text=>"Customers are responsible for managing user access permissions"}, {:control_id=>"PNC 36", :control_text=>"Customers are responsible for securing end-user devices"}, {:control_id=>"PNC 37", :control_text=>"Customers are responsible for configuring integrations appropriately"}], :url_extracted_controls=>[{:control_id=>"UNC 1", :control_text=>"System access restricted to authorized access only"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 2", :control_text=>"The company has a data classification policy in place to help ensure that confidential data is properly secured and restricted to authorized personnel"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 3", :control_text=>"The company requires authentication to production datastores to use authorized secure authentication mechanisms, such as unique SSH key"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 4", :control_text=>"The company restricts privileged access to encryption keys to authorized users with a business need"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 5", :control_text=>"The company requires authentication to systems and applications to use unique username and password or authorized Secure Socket Shell (SSH) keys"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 6", :control_text=>"The company restricts privileged access to databases to authorized users with a business need"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 7", :control_text=>"The company restricts privileged access to the firewall to authorized users with a business need"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 8", :control_text=>"The company restricts privileged access to the operating system to authorized users with a business need"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 9", :control_text=>"The company restricts privileged access to the production network to authorized users with a business need"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 10", :control_text=>"The company requires authentication to the \"production network\" to use unique usernames and passwords or authorized Secure Socket Shell (SSH) keys"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 11", :control_text=>"The company deploys anti-malware technology to environments commonly susceptible to malicious attacks and configures this to be updated routinely, logged, and installed on all relevant systems"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 12", :control_text=>"The company managers are required to complete performance evaluations for direct reports at least annually"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 13", :control_text=>"The company requires passwords for in-scope system components to be configured according to the company's policy"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 14", :control_text=>"The company's datastores housing sensitive customer data are encrypted at rest"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 15", :control_text=>"The company's access control policy documents the requirements for the following access control functions: adding new users; modifying users; and/or removing an existing user's access"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 16", :control_text=>"The company has electronic media containing confidential information purged or destroyed in accordance with best practices, and certificates of destruction are issued for each device destroyed"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 17", :control_text=>"The company encrypts portable and removable media devices when used"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 18", :control_text=>"The comp