ity/Disaster Recovery (BC/DR) plan and tests it at least annually"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 29", :control_text=>"The company maintains cybersecurity insurance to mitigate the financial impact of business disruptions"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 30", :control_text=>"The company has a configuration management procedure in place to ensure that system configurations are deployed consistently throughout the environment"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 31", :control_text=>"The company has a formal systems development life cycle (SDLC) methodology in place that governs the development, acquisition, implementation, changes (including emergency changes), and maintenance of information systems and related technology requirements"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 32", :control_text=>"The company has established a formalized whistleblower policy, and an anonymous communication channel is in place for users to report potential issues or fraud concerns"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 33", :control_text=>"The company's board of directors or a relevant subcommittee is briefed by senior management at least annually on the state of the company's cybersecurity and privacy risk. The board provides feedback and direction to management as needed"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 34", :control_text=>"The company's board of directors has a documented charter that outlines its oversight responsibilities for internal control"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 35", :control_text=>"The company's board members have sufficient expertise to oversee management's ability to design, implement and operate information security controls. The board engages third-party information security experts and consultants as needed"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 36", :control_text=>"The company has formal retention and disposal procedures in place to guide the secure retention and disposal of company and customer data"}, {:control_id=>"UNC 37", :control_text=>"The company purges or removes customer data containing confidential information from the application environment, in accordance with best practices, when customers leave the service"}], :pdf_control_mappings=>[], :url_control_mappings=>{:mappings=>[{:source_row_index=>0, :source_control_ids=>["CC 1.1", "CC 1.4"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["UNC 18"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"Direct match for background checks on new employees."}, {:source_row_index=>1, :source_control_ids=>["CC 1.1"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["UNC 19"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"Exact match for contractor code of conduct requirement."}, {:source_row_index=>2, :source_control_ids=>["CC 1.1", "CC 1.5"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["UNC 20"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"Full alignment with code of conduct acknowledgment and disciplinary actions."}, {:source_row_index=>3, :source_control_ids=>["CC 1.1"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["UNC 21"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"Direct match for contractor confidentiality agreements."}, {:source_row_index=>4, :source_control_ids=>["CC 1.1"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["UNC 22"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"Exact match for employee confidentiality agreements during onboarding."}, {:source_row_index=>5, :source_control_ids=>["CC 1.1", "CC 1.4", "CC 1.5"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["UNC 12"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"Direct match for annual performance evaluations by managers."}, {:source_row_index=>6, :source_control_ids=>["CC 1.2", "CC 1.3"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["UNC 34"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"Exact match for board charter outlining oversight responsibilities."}, {:source_row_index=>7, :source_control_ids=>["CC 1.2"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["UNC 33"], :match_type=>"full", :rationale=>"Full alignment with annual board briefing on cybersecurity risks."}, {:source_row_index=>8, :source_control_ids=>["CC 1.3", "CC 2.2"], :normalized_common_control_ids=>["UNC 35"], :match_type=>"partial", :rationale=>"Partially matches UNC 35's focus on board expertise and third-party engagement, b